# NB: This file has been produced using GenAI
# Two targets in one graph family resolve to different receipt models.
# The shipped example names ex:Widget only through dal:coversClass, and compile
# discovers targets through dal:targetClass alone, so ex:Widget is never
# compiled and the warning never leaves compile. This adds the scope that makes
# ex:Widget a target. See the status record, finding F-1.
# base: warning-mixed-receipt-model.ttl
@prefix dal: <https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/persistence#> .
@prefix ex:  <https://example.org/lending#> .
@prefix sh:  <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .

ex:WidgetClass a dal:ClassScope ; dal:targetClass ex:Widget ; dal:priority 0 .
